{
  "about": [
    "Which ordo-host test binaries each ordo-host source file reaches (owner ruling 2026-11-02, board task test-in-proportion-to-the-change ask 2).",
    "A push to bleeding that changes a mapped file runs only those binaries of ordo-host (scripts/ci-affected.mjs). \"all\" runs every one, and is always safe.",
    "Every file under crates/ordo-host/src must be here; node scripts/ci-affected.test.mjs fails otherwise.",
    "First made 2026-11-02: a file maps to the tests that name its module or its public items, plus the tests that boot a whole app, plus the tests of the feature files that call it. Files on every request path, and files no test names, are \"all\"."
  ],
